---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import BudgetCalculator from '../../components/BudgetCalculator.astro';
---
<Layout title="流量预算计算器" description="从一段使用记录估算目标周期需要的计费额度，区分实际传输量和后台已扣额度，避免重复乘倍率。" crumbs={[{name:'预算工具',url:'/tools/'},{name:'流量预算计算器',url:'/tools/traffic/'}]}>
<div class="container"><div class="page-intro"><span class="eyebrow">BUDGET WITH CLEAR ASSUMPTIONS</span><h1>流量预算计算器</h1><p>从一段使用记录估算目标周期需要的计费额度，区分实际传输量和后台已扣额度，避免重复乘倍率。</p></div><BudgetCalculator kind="traffic"><label class="budget-field" for="sample"><span>样本用量（GB）</span><input id="sample" name="sample" type="number" min="0" max="100000000" step="any" placeholder="例如 14" aria-describedby="sample-help" required/><small id="sample-help">包含全部设备与计费方向；尽量覆盖工作日和周末。</small></label><label class="budget-field" for="days"><span>样本天数</span><input id="days" name="days" type="number" min="0.01" max="3660" step="any" placeholder="例如 7" aria-describedby="days-help" required/><small id="days-help">与用量统计窗口一致。</small></label><label class="budget-field" for="targetDays"><span>目标周期天数</span><input id="targetDays" name="targetDays" type="number" min="0.01" max="3660" step="any" placeholder="例如 30" aria-describedby="targetDays-help" required/><small id="targetDays-help">按实际重置周期填写，不固定为自然月。</small></label><label class="budget-field" for="meter"><span>样本计量口径</span><select id="meter" name="meter"><option value="raw">实际传输量（尚未乘倍率）</option><option value="billed">后台已扣额度（已含倍率）</option></select><small>后台已扣额度会直接按日均推算，不再乘倍率。</small></label><label class="budget-field" for="multiplier"><span>预计统一倍率</span><input id="multiplier" name="multiplier" type="number" min="0.01" max="1000" step="any" placeholder="例如 1" aria-describedby="multiplier-help" required/><small id="multiplier-help">实际传输量需要乘倍率；后台已扣额度模式忽略此项。</small></label><label class="budget-field" for="reserve"><span>额外预留比例（%）</span><input id="reserve" name="reserve" type="number" min="0" max="100" step="any" placeholder="例如 20" aria-describedby="reserve-help" required/><small id="reserve-help">在预测基础上额外增加的比例，不是可保证的安全额度。</small></label></BudgetCalculator><section class="budget-explainer"><h2>怎么算？</h2><p>基础预测 = 样本用量 ÷ 样本天数 × 目标周期天数。样本为实际传输量时，再乘统一倍率；样本为后台已扣额度时直接使用基础预测。建议预算 = 基础预测 ×（1 + 预留比例 ÷ 100）。</p><p>预测假设未来任务和使用强度与样本相近。临时下载、测速、视频会议或节点倍率变化可能使结果偏离。这里估算完整目标周期；周期中途应另行核对剩余天数与剩余额度。</p><p><a href="/tools/">返回预算工具</a> · <a href="/blog/traffic-budget/">阅读计算口径与使用建议</a></p></section></div></Layout>